WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.800
<i>Lief began to tell the story he heard from his dad, Jarred.</i>

00:02:55.090 --> 00:03:02.400
<i>About how darkness befell the kingdom because the King of Deltora, Endon, didn't wear the Belt of Deltora around his waist.</i>

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:10.000
<i>Jarred then left the palace, waiting for the day King Endon would wear the belt once more to come.</i>

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:15.920
<i>And at last, the day Endon would send his signal has finally come,</i>

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:22.200
<i>As the glimmer of a golden arrow could be seen in the great tree of the palace.</i>

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:30.780
The night before my father, Jarred headed to the palace...

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:33.010
A certain woman lost her life...

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.510
Her name was Min.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.600
Endon and Jarred's nursing mother,

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.000
As well as Barda's mother...

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.400
Finally.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.600
This moment has finally come!

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:33.930
A toy arrow?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.200
Is this Endon's too?

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:37.900
A message?

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.550
"Wake the Bear,

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.850
Do not fear, scurry mouse,

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.280
Into your house,

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:50.300
Lift the lid, be glad you did."

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.720
It's what Endon drew when he was a kid, huh...

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.440
Oh, I see!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.800
He deliberately brought out his old drawings as a message for me!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.900
"Wake the Bear"...

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.000
Does he mean this?

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.340
"Lift the lid"...

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.150
Only this part is bare!

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.000
"Do not fear, scurry mouse"...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.290
"Into your house"...

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.700
A dead end?!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:55.700
No, wait...

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.600
"Lift the lid, be glad you did"...

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.820
This is... the chapel?

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:08.500
Who is it?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.150
Don't move!

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.460
I'm Jarred the Blacksmith!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.700
Jarred... the Blacksmith?

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:17.850
Jarred!

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.530
Is that really you?! So you have come!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.600
Endon?

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.530
Forgive me, my friend.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:30.650
Can you forgive my past foolishness for the sake of our friendship?

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:32.550
You were right...

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.860
I should have believed you back then!

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.220
I beg of you...

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:37.950
Please save us!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.670
Kings shouldn't kneel so easily, Endon.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.600
Come, raise your head so I can see your face again.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:03.300
You're the Endon I know, without a doubt. You've really grown, haven't you?

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.000
You too, I almost didn't recognize you...

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:11.240
That is an emergency exit known only to the royal family.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.300
Even the chief advisors know nothing of it.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:15.870
I see...

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:20.700
This code you left behind, "aim high and I'll come"...

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:23.630
It made me believe that you would be waiting for me.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.220
That's right, I did wait for your signal, all this time!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:30.400
I believed that the day you'd realise your error would come.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.230
What's wrong?

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:35.400
I have some bad news for you...

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.400
No way... It couldn't be...

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.800
It's Min... The very same Min who nursed us.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.300
How could this happen...?!

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:54.700
Min was... rushing to my room last night...

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:58.930
She said that she had overheard something terrible in the sewing room.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.360
Something terrible...?

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:03.810
She said that there's a traitor in the palace...

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:10.000
And that this person was communicating with an evildoer who's aiming for this kingdom, and that they will attack at daybreak!

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:17.320
I didn't believe her at that time... So all I did was calm her down and send her on her way...

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:21.580
And when dawn came, I found out that she had fallen down the stairs and died...!

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:25.300
My retainers told me that it was an accident, but I just can't believe that...!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.300
So you sent me that signal...

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.570
I saw the Seven Ak-Baba on my way here.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:35.720
What?! You mean, those monsters of legend?!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:38.900
Legends no more however, as they're now circling the palace.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.700
I knew it, Min was right...

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.400
And yet I...!

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.150
Endon, please! You need to get to the tower, now!

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.300
We need the Belt of Deltora!

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.500
It's far too late...

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.700
If the Ak-Baba have already come, then...

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:58.990
Darling...?

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:02.410
Sharn...

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:07.200
It's alright, he is Jarred.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.390
Oh my!

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:11.300
So you have come to us, Jarred!

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:17.650
Your Majesty, I have come to lend my strength to help save this kingdom from evil.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.470
We don't have much time. We need to go to the tower,

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:23.460
And make Endon wear the Belt of Deltora immediately!

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:27.240
But, the Rule states that...

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:31.500
The Rule?! Endon, have you not realised your past mistake?!

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.120
But still...

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:34.500
Darling.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:37.280
You are the king.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:43.500
Rather than obeying the Rule, isn't it more important for you to protect the people of this country?

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:47.700
Either way, you will need the belt. Let's go!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.250
It's the Ak-Baba!

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.740
They are coming for the treasury!

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:05.890
Take them down!

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:06.690
Hurry up!

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.500
Wait, Barda!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.000
Captain?

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.260
I've heard about what happened to Min.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.800
Why didn't you go to her?

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:24.300
Even though His Majesty was kind enough to lay her body in the chapel, Barda.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:30.390
Last night, my mother actually came to the guard house and told me to leave the palace as soon as possible...

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.180
What...?!

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:35.480
Perhaps she felt that her death was near...

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:40.750
However, I lashed back at her, saying that "what kind of guard would I be if I abandoned the palace?".

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:45.200
That's why, I won't be able to face my mother if I leave my post now!

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:51.320
I'll definitely apologise to my mother personally after we have defended the palace! Now excuse me!!

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:51.980
Barda!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:08.570
You damned monster!

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.040
Shit!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.740
The treasury has been breached!!

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:39.900
Oh no!

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.090
Let's go on.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.300
How awful...

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.390
Where's the belt?!

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.460
Damned monster...!

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:51.600
Jarred!

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:15.100
All of the gems have been taken...

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.830
We were too late...

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.200
We were far too late...!

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:25.700
Prandine!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:27.800
Oh ho...

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:30.880
So the Jarred who perished at sea has been revived, now?

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:36.130
But it is futile, for Deltora will soon be under the rule of my master.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:38.200
Prandine, you bastard!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:39.420
Endon!

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:45.940
Be still!

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:52.640
This dagger has been smeared with a powerful poison, such that even a tiny scratch will definitely kill, you see?

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.020
Just like how the former king...

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.500
Ah yes, and how that 'Min' died, you see?

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.360
You dirty traitor...!!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.210
A traitor?

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.840
What funny things you do say.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:08.900
I have served the Shadow Lord and no one else from the very beginning.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:13.540
Much like the chief advisors before me; they all served him, you see?

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.920
With this, the foolish king's lineage is done for, Endon.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:22.610
Do you have any idea how simple it was to weaken the lot of you,

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:28.400
Snatching away your power to protect the kingdom and making you little more than our mindless puppets?

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:33.300
Now, even the belt that Adin the Blacksmith forged is in pieces!

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:36.100
The Belt of Deltora has been eliminated for good!

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:40.000
But, you cannot destroy the seven gems!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.800
The gems have long since departed this kingdom,

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.800
Hidden in seven places where no one can find them!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:51.610
Besides, if the child inside the queen's belly is killed, those gems will be little more than useless pebbles anyway!

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:53.440
No! Please don't!

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.500
My Lord!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:11.010
The great Shadow Lord!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.700
What is it?

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:26.290
N-No, it was nothing.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.010
It was nothing!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.140
So you have more allies, huh?

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.620
That's not true! What allies?!

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:37.620
Is that right?

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.000
Be still, the both of you!

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:42.990
If you move, the life of the queen will be forfeit.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.870
I'm serious, there's no one there!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.200
Out of the way! I will decide that for myself!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:55.990
Unhand me!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.500
Sharn, was that...?

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.960
Yes, it was all an act...

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:16.150
It seems that I won the gamble.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.580
You sure married a splendid woman, Endon...

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:28.490
Now that we've lost the power of the belt, there's nothing that will stop the Shadow Lord...

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:30.100
He's coming.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:33.100
Let's go. We need to leave this place fast.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.270
What is it, Endon? Let's go.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.160
I can't...

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:55.190
I just can't bring myself to abandon the palace and the kingdom like this...!

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:58.700
We're not abandoning them, we're just going to lay low for a while.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:03.270
You have to stay alive.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:08.390
This kingdom will forever be under the Shadow Lord's rule if the two of you die here.

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:11.870
He's right. We should hide somewhere that's safe.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:12.780
You're right.

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:16.800
We have to search for the seven gems, then return them to the belt!

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:21.930
Let's head to my forge. I'll try to do something about the belt there.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.400
Anyway, we shouldn't stay here any longer!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.400
Please wear this, Your Majesty.

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:35.000
Thank you.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.000
You're expecting too? When are you due?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.480
This Autumn, I believe.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.170
I hope both of us will give birth to healthy children.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:44.690
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.090
Just call me Sharn. And you are...?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:51.420
My name is Anna, Lady Sharn.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.900
We will definitely get the gems back!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:58.220
But what if I die before that point?!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:02.500
The belt is worthless if there are no descendants of Adin to wear it!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.300
Endon...

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:05.600
What?

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:10.610
To be clear, you have long since lost the people's trust.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.610
What...?!

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:17.400
We both know that you won't be able to harness the Belt of Deltora's true power without the people's trust.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:21.520
We completely fell for the Shadow Lord's trap.

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:25.230
He's led us up to this point for a long time, after all.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:27.440
If only I had pulled myself together...!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.250
That's right, this is all my fault...!

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.000
Darling...

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.300
Please don't put all of the blame on yourself...

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.060
Besides, don't forget,

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:45.460
Our child is Adin's descendant too, right?

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.970
From now on, it's a war of attrition between us and the Shadow Lord.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.850
We need to hide ourselves for the time being,

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:55.570
So that we can entrust Deltora's future to our unborn child.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:19:01.100
Even if we both end up dying, we still have this child to continue our struggle, after all.

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:05.250
<i>And thus, King Endon and Queen Sharn,</i>

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:10.200
<i>Set out on a journey to entrust Deltora's fate to their unborn child.</i>

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:26.900
<i>Jarred, to the best of his ability, repaired the belt and vowed to reclaim the gems.</i>

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:37.030
And after I was born,

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:42.500
My dad, Jarred, entrusted the gathering of the gems to me.

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:48.580
You've gone through a lot...

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.800
Both you... and Barda...

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:59.020
Did you find something, Kree?

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:02.620
What did he say?

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.820
He said that there's a big tree up ahead which is perfect to hide under!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.500
Barda!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.740
Go on without me.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.000
Barda...?

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:22.390
It's the Ak-Baba!

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:25.450
I'm not the same as I was back then!

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.070
One Ak-Baba is nothing for me!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:28.630
What are you saying?!

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:29.300
Barda...!

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.600
You have to live, Barda!

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:41.060
We still need you with us!

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:45.200
Endure it, at least until all of the gems have been gathered!

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:07.550
I'm sorry, Lief...

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:15.530
Hearing your story evoked a lot of past memories and emotions in me...

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:17.570
I'm really sorry.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:24.210
Okay, we're going now!

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:34.930
What do you think?

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.220
It's the perfect place to hide, right?

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:49.530
This a good tree. I can tell.

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:52.200
Yeah, I agree.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.100
It's as if telling us to rest here...

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:01.300
How kind of it.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:04.800
It's as if...

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.740 --> 00:24:07.830
Prandine.

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:10.540
One of the Shadow Lord's servants,

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:15.410
He snuck into the Kingdom of Deltora and made a fool of its kings for generations.

00:24:15.840 --> 00:24:19.490
He helped the Shadow Lord's invasion and in the end, drove the king away.

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:26.100
After we arrived in the town of Rithmere, we then went to Mother Brightly's Inn to register for the games.

00:24:26.690 --> 00:24:30.780
And there, we encountered the guy with a scar on his cheek who we met in Tom's shop!

00:24:30.780 --> 00:24:31.440
GOOD LUCK? BAD LUCK?

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:34.660
Next time, 'Good Luck? Bad Luck?'
